LAB_000007be:
000007be  4e73                  rte

; snd_cmd_recv_word: Receives ONE word from the latch per interrupt and leaves it at 0x201000 +
;   index; the index lives in d0's high word and advances by 2 up to 0x60 (48 words = 96 bytes = 6
;   registers of 16). On completing it returns to snd_cmd_idle. The protocol is blind: the sound CPU
;   answers nothing.
; runs from 0x002012cc
snd_cmd_recv_word:
